{"answer":null,"concept_id":"occupancy-limiter-registers-smem-blocks","content_sha256":"sha256:7845124f9a5ecea9dcfc71e15d959f53c82060e7c47d02fe28dfea2dac07653a","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789365708.133344,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"已有寄存器过多、占用高≠快。补 ncu 怎么读 limiter。","id":"q-operator-occupancy-limited-by-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"看哪项的 theoretical occupancy 最低：寄存器墙就减活变量/改 launch bounds；smem 墙就缩 tile/num_stages；block 数墙就改 grid。三项都高仍慢，说明占用不是瓶颈，转去 pipe/带宽"},{"id":"b","text":"三项总是一起变，不必分开看"},{"id":"c","text":"只有寄存器会限制占用，smem 不影响"},{"id":"d","text":"occupancy 报告与性能无关，可以忽略"}],"prompt":"ncu Occupancy 报告里 registers per thread、smem per block、blocks per SM 三项，如何判断谁在卡占用？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA Nsight Compute","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-compute/NsightCompute/index.html"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"cuda-performance","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
